{"4139940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SpliceBorn", "steam_appid": 4139940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Silence is survival.</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity’s last attempt to cheat old age ended in catastrophe. An experiment with stem cells and a so-called “youth vaccine” gave birth to a hive organism that consumed cities and people.<br>Those who merged with it aren’t your typical zombies. They’re part of the network: grotesque, cunning, and hypersensitive to sound. <br>They hunt together. They think together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139940/extras/488b73ca1fd849672aa30ce6f26d4240.poster.avif?t=1770919169\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139940/extras/488b73ca1fd849672aa30ce6f26d4240.webm?t=1770919169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139940/extras/488b73ca1fd849672aa30ce6f26d4240.mp4?t=1770919169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You are a Supplier.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A scavenger who ventures beyond the walls in small teams of 1–4, searching for what’s left of humanity: medicine, food, tools, and rare contract items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition is a gamble. <br>Shattered glass, collapsing shelves, chains whispering in the dark, every sound could summon the swarm.<br>One wrong move, and the whole hive comes for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Stealth first. Improvisation second.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guns exist, but they’re loud, rare, and dangerous to use.<br>Every shot is a risk: is the noise worth it and can you escape with the loot before they close in?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distract, lure, plan, and adapt.<br>Survive long enough to extract, and you’ll bring home valuable gear, medicine, and resources.<br>Fail and you lose everything you carried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Hive Listens. It Watches. It Learns.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different enemies share one mind:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Listeners react to the faintest sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Watchers sense light and movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Swarm-born connect them all, spreading the alert through a living network.<br><br>Make too much noise, and they’ll surround you from every direction.<br>They evolve their tactics and they don’t stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are no second chances.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > One mistake is enough — panic, noise, or hesitation will be punished immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139940/extras/594736c3a55d55bcbe1c936b3a58f128.poster.avif?t=1770919169\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139940/extras/594736c3a55d55bcbe1c936b3a58f128.webm?t=1770919169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139940/extras/594736c3a55d55bcbe1c936b3a58f128.mp4?t=1770919169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objects make noise.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every interaction matters. A dropped bottle or a bumped shelf can expose your position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139940/extras/9e66b04e3654e1a65673a829f5b8f59a.poster.avif?t=1770919169\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139940/extras/9e66b04e3654e1a65673a829f5b8f59a.webm?t=1770919169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139940/extras/9e66b04e3654e1a65673a829f5b8f59a.mp4?t=1770919169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They hunt by sound.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > They don’t rely on sight alone. Even the quietest movement can draw them in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139940/extras/7d0eb0cbed77d3a087e6a6c92bf6bcfa.poster.avif?t=1770919169\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139940/extras/7d0eb0cbed77d3a087e6a6c92bf6bcfa.webm?t=1770919169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139940/extras/7d0eb0cbed77d3a087e6a6c92bf6bcfa.mp4?t=1770919169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Co-op is everything.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission demands teamwork.<br>One sets traps, another hauls supplies, a third covers the retreat.<br>Silence, patience, and smart decisions keep you alive, not heroics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, the survivors aren’t the strongest.<br>They’re the quietest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Silence is survival.</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity’s last 