trong>The Hive Listens. It Watches. It Learns.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different enemies share one mind:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Listeners react to the faintest sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Watchers sense light and movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Swarm-born connect them all, spreading the alert through a living network.<br><br>Make too much noise, and they’ll surround you from every direction.<br>They evolve their tactics and they don’t stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are no second chances.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > One mistake is enough — panic, noise, or hesitation will be punished immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139940/extras/594736c3a55d55bcbe1c936b3a58f128.poster.avif?t=1770919169\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139940/extras/594736c3a55d55bcbe1c936b3a58f128.webm?t=1770919169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139940/extras/594736c3a55d55bcbe1c936b3a58f128.mp4?t=1770919169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objects make noise.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every interaction matters. A dropped bottle or a bumped shelf can expose your position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139940/extras/9e66b04e3654e1a65673a829f5b8f59a.poster.avif?t=1770919169\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139940/extras/9e66b04e3654e1a6567